WEBVTT

01:07:29.458 --> 01:07:30.768
EP: You know, it's a --

01:07:30.792 --> 01:07:33.184
And by the way, I don't know if --

01:07:33.208 --> 01:07:34.851
You know, I speak a few languages

01:07:34.875 --> 01:07:37.143
and I don't know the term
in other languages.

01:07:37.167 --> 01:07:38.726
It doesn't translate in my head.

01:07:38.750 --> 01:07:42.726
Does anybody have a translation for this?
French, Hebrew, German, Spanish, anybody?

01:07:42.750 --> 01:07:43.768
(Laughter)

01:07:43.792 --> 01:07:45.268
It's an interesting thing.

01:07:45.292 --> 01:07:49.018
It's like, you know,
you work with that person.

01:07:49.042 --> 01:07:52.559
You know, whatever it is that happens,

01:07:52.583 --> 01:07:54.143
but it's not your work spouse.

01:07:54.167 --> 01:07:55.518
AG: Like closest colleague.

01:07:55.542 --> 01:07:57.934
EP: Don't do the laundry
of that person, you know?

01:07:57.958 --> 01:07:59.101
(Laughter)

01:07:59.125 --> 01:08:02.184
AG: Well, this has been fun
and enlightening as always.